**2.05    Repayment of Loans. Each Borrower shall repay to the Lenders on the Maturity Date the aggregate principal amount**

of Loans made to such Borrower and outstanding on the Maturity Date.

**2.06    Interest.**

(a)      Subject to the provisions of subsection (b) below:

(i)     each Term SOFR Borrowing shall bear interest on the outstanding principal amount thereof for the

Interest Period applicable to such Borrowing at a rate per annum equal to the Term SOFR for such Interest Period
plus the Applicable Rate;

(ii)    each EURIBOR Borrowing shall bear interest on the outstanding principal amount thereof for the

Interest Period applicable to such Borrowing at a rate per annum equal to the EURIBO Rate for such Interest Period
plus the Applicable Rate;

(iii)    each TIBOR Borrowing shall bear interest on the outstanding principal amount thereof for the

Interest Period applicable to such Borrowing at a rate per annum equal to the TIBO Rate for such Interest Period plus
the Applicable Rate;

(iv)    each SONIA Borrowing shall bear interest on the outstanding principal amount thereof from the

applicable borrowing date at a rate per annum equal to the Daily Simple SONIA plus the Applicable Rate;

(v)    each CDOR Borrowing shall bear interest on the outstanding principal amount thereof for the Interest

Period applicable to such Borrowing at a rate per annum equal to the CDO Rate for such Interest Period plus the
Applicable Rate;

(vi)   each ABBR Borrowing shall bear interest on the outstanding principal amount thereof for the Interest

Period applicable to such Borrowing at a rate per annum equal to the AUD Bank Bill Rate for such Interest Period
plus the Applicable Rate;

(vii)   each SARON Borrowing shall bear interest on the outstanding principal amount thereof from the

applicable borrowing date at a rate per annum equal to the Daily Simple SARON plus the Applicable Rate;

(viii)  each Base Rate Borrowing shall bear interest on the outstanding principal amount thereof from the

applicable borrowing or conversion date at a rate per annum equal to the Base Rate plus the Applicable Rate;

(ix)    each Daily Simple SOFR Borrowing, if available pursuant to Section 3.03, shall bear interest on the

outstanding principal amount thereof from the applicable borrowing or conversion date at a rate per annum equal to
the Daily Simple SOFR plus the Applicable Rate;

